7.3 Contributors retain ownership. This License alone neither assigns
copyright nor grants the Licensor a blanket right to issue commercial
exceptions for others' contributions. The Baseten permission in Section 4
is an express part of the license every INFOIL Contributor grants; it does
not depend on such a separate commercial exception.

8. ATTRIBUTION, MARKS, AND OUTPUTS

8.1 Reasonable attribution and identification of origin are permitted.
No trademark rights or endorsement are granted, including by naming a
